     3	// OQ-3 scenario ledger. Every step is declared before execution with its class:
     4	//   required-dispatch  a model request must reach the daemon, with the stated expectation per request;
     5	//   required-refusal   a production operation must refuse (for example a reload during a held turn);
     6	//   operation          a production operation with a stated expected outcome (save, reload, CLI);
     7	//   harness            process control and fixtures; a failure makes the run invalid, never a defect.
     8	// Trial identities are frozen here; a trial that fails to start is still counted.
     9	
